  "plugins": [
    {
      "name": "dsh-session-inbox",
      "title": {
        "en": "DSH Session Workbench",
        "zh": "DSH 会话工作台"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Compact session workbench with rounded icons, floating Undo, native menus, search and metadata backups. Version 0.5.0 enhances the current native UI and falls back on detected incompatibility. Admits DSH 0.1.7-rc.1 through pre-1.0 releases except 0.2.2-alpha.2; future releases are not claimed as tested. 16 native regression fixtures, 91 code/installer tests and 45 isolated Windows Web checks across 0.1.7-rc.1, 0.2.1-rc.5 and 0.2.2-rc.1. Chinese UI; no model API calls in this matrix.",
        "zh": "圆角图标、底部浮动撤销、原生菜单、搜索和整理备份。0.5.0 增强当前宿主原生界面，检测到不兼容时回退原生列表。准入范围为 DSH 0.1.7-rc.1 起至 1.0 预发布之前，排除 0.2.2-alpha.2；不将未来版本标为已实测。16 组原生回归样本、91 项代码和安装器测试，以及 0.1.7-rc.1、0.2.1-rc.5、0.2.2-rc.1 共 45 项 Windows 隔离 Web 检查。中文界面，矩阵未调用模型 API。"
      },
      "author": "Tracest",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/Tracest/dsh-session-inbox",
      "repository": {
        "url": "https://github.com/Tracest/dsh-session-inbox"
      },
